{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Free Castle: Survival Store&quot; is a first person store simulator in a post apocalyptic zombie invasion era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Run a Store in the Dead Zone?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, trade, clean, fight\u2014and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Store</strong> mixes simulation and chaos in a gritty post-apocalyptic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every task you complete earns trust. Every mess you leave and every action you take might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the business alive when the world\u2019s falling apart?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/2e5c52e4f7d3f04be929b9c7f39af791.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/2e5c52e4f7d3f04be929b9c7f39af791.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/9f3b80b930244b36dfb81e5947bd774c.avif?t=1756806830\" data-has-big width=800 height=109 /></span><i>Loot, haggle, and build your rep.</i> <br>Scavenge goods, bargain with stubborn survivors, and boost your reputation by keeping them alive\u2014and satisfied.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/374cf56859a6ee93858f741878b96a2a.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/374cf56859a6ee93858f741878b96a2a.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/7c24971cd8d6d0225f02274ae3f808a7.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/7c24971cd8d6d0225f02274ae3f808a7.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Build your outpost from scratch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place furniture, set up defensive structures, and organize your survivor hub with total freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/13c1cd52bcbb0f098bf69c81b9c212b1.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/13c1cd52bcbb0f098bf69c81b9c212b1.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/9146a10db9dbbcb9db5a435356794151.avif?t=1756806830\" data-has-big width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They hear you. They see you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a sound, and they\u2019ll come. Get spotted, and they\u2019ll chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/979cdb3d630074518c35e343f68cd02f.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/979cdb3d630074518c35e343f68cd02f.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/cf941a8b5e8966d191600cda4ba24d5c.avif?t=1756806830\" data-has-big width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waves of undead. Endless bloodshed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face massive hordes in brutal combat. Use melee, guns, and traps to survive the swarm\u2014or get swallowed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/4246923227a9ce25bc0056b078638e57.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/4246923227a9ce25bc0056b078638e57.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/2dfb399d42a434b2f9a3d056faa390ee.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/2dfb399d42a434b2f9a3d056faa390ee.webm?t=1756806830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450410/extras/01b9b302f589edbf4446877c952a8c9f.poster.avif?t=1756806830\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"h